:INFO
Art. 130 Duty to provide information
1 The valuation experts and real estate companies belonging to the collective investment scheme shall provide the audit company with full access to the accounting records, the accounting vouchers, the records and to the reports of the valuation experts; moreover, they shall supply them with all the information needed to perform the audit function.
2 The audit company of the custodian bank and the audit company of the other licensees cooperate with each other.
|

:NOTE
Art. 130 — Amended by Annex No 14 of the Financial Market Supervision Act of 22 June 2007, in force since 1 Jan. 2009 (AS 2008 5207 5205; BBl 2006 2829).
|

